      "quote": "One is hungry, and another is drunken.",
      "title": "An unequal meal is the firm starting point",
      "note": "The contrast concerns access to food and drink within a gathering. It warrants asking about resources and conduct. It supplies neither a membership census nor the dimensions of a dining room."
